        "jsCode": "// Fetch all users with keywords from Judic-IA\nconst supabaseUrl = 'https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co';\nconst serviceKey = 'YOUR_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY';\n\n// Note: In production, store these as n8n credentials or env vars\n// For now this node is a placeholder — replace with actual Supabase HTTP call\n\nconst boData = {\n  primera: $('Fetch BO Primera Sección').item.json,\n  segunda: $('Fetch BO Segunda Sección').item.json,\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: { boData, timestamp: new Date().toISOString() } }];"
